  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam Prosperity Bank Expanding Access to Finance for Women-Owned Small and Medium-sized Enterprises Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed loan of up to $500 million to Vietnam Prosperity Joint Stock Commercial Bank comprising (i) a senior unsecured A Loan of up to $100,000,000 and (ii) B Loan of up to $400,000,000, expanding access to finance for women-owned small and medium-sized enterprises.</narrative>
  </description>
